      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "In 1829 John Rimer built a cabin and opened a tavern that served rye whiskey, becoming the gathering spot for early pioneers.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        4,
        27
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 2",
        "Web source 1"
      ],
      "source": "https://grokipedia.com/page/rimersburg_pennsylvania",
      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Rimersburg grew as a rural hub for agriculture, manufacturing, and mining, with schools opening in 1835 and a collegiate institute founded in 1859.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        2
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 2"
      ],
